{"step_index":817,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:13:26Z","thinking":"Observed registration date: 2012-11-07, telephone number: 070-7579-5330, and status: \"폐업자\" (closed business). The primary goal is to determine the business's closure date.\n\nThe closure date, extracted from the status information, is \"(폐업일 : 20130318)\". Parsing that, the closure date is confirmed as 2013-03-18.\n\n\nThe data fields are reviewed, specifically the significance of `bizno.net` data.  Blank fields for year, month, phone, fax, and employee count will be populated from parsed data sources. Also, if the '폐업 날짜' is blank and there is a '폐업자' note, I must fill that in.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"Script to scrape all details from bizno.net for all 150 filled companies and populate every single blank column\",\"UserFacing\":false}","CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\nconst path = require('path');\\nconst https = require('https');\\n\\nconst SCRATCH_DIR = 'C:\\\\\\\\Users\\\\\\\\lg\\\\\\\\.gemini\\\\\\\\antigravity\\\\\\\\brain\\\\\\\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\\\\\\\scratch';\\nconst list = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync(path.join(SCRATCH_DIR, 'filled_companies_summary.json'), 'utf8'));\\n\\nconsole.log('Total companies to fetch details for:', list.length);\\n\\nfunction fetchUrl(url) {\\n    return new Promise(resolve => {\\n        https.get(url, {\\n            headers: {\\n                'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/128.0.0.0 Safari/537.36'\\n            },\\n            timeout: 7000\\n        }, res => {\\n            let d = '';\\n            res.on('data', c => d += c);\\n            res.on('end', () => resolve(d));\\n        }).on('error', () => resolve('')).on('timeout', function() { this.destroy(); resolve(''); });\\n    });\\n}\\n\\nfunction parseBiznoHtml(html) {\\n    if (!html) return {};\\n    const info = {};\\n\\n    // 1. Meta description parsing\\n    const metaM = html.match(/<meta\\\\s+name=[\\\"']description[\\\"']\\\\s+content=[\\\"']([^\\\"']+)[\\\"']/i);\\n    if (metaM) {\\n        const text = metaM[1];\\n        const getField = (label) => {\\n            const reg = new RegExp(label + '\\\\\\\\s*:\\\\\\\\s*([^:]+?)(?=\\\\\\\\s+[가-힣A-Za-z0-9_()\\\\\\\\/]+?\\\\\\\\s*:|$)', 'i');\\n            const m = reg.exec(text);\\n            return m ? m[1].trim() : '';\\n        };\\n\\n        const regDate = getField('설립일\\\\\\\\(신고\\\\\\\\/인허가일\\\\\\\\)');\\n        if (regDate) {\\n            info.regDate = regDate;\\n            const ym = regDate.match(/([0-9]{4})-([0-9]{2})/);\\n            if (ym) {\\n                info.year = ym[1];\\n                info.month = String(parseInt(ym[2], 10));\\n            }\\n        }\\n\\n        const tel = getField('전화번호');\\n        if (tel && !tel.includes('***')) info.tel = tel;\\n\\n        const fax = getField('팩스번호');\\n        if (fax && !fax.includes('***')) info.fax = fax;\\n\\n\n<truncated 3069 bytes>","Description":"\"Script to scrape all details from bizno.net for all 150 filled companies\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\\\scratch\\\\fetch_and_fill_all_columns.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing fetch_and_fill_all_columns.js\"","toolSummary":"\"Create fetch_and_fill_all_columns.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
